WEBVTT

00:06.896 --> 00:08.137
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.241 --> 00:10.000
<i>Aye-aye, Captain!</i>
<i>是的，队长！</i>

00:10.103 --> 00:11.379
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

00:11.482 --> 00:13.724
<i>Aye-aye, Captain!</i>
<i>是的，队长！</i>

00:13.827 --> 00:16.413
<i>♪ Ooh ♪</i>
<i>♪ 噢 ♪</i>

00:16.517 --> 00:18.517
<i>♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪</i>
<i>♪谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪</i>

00:18.620 --> 00:20.551
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:20.655 --> 00:22.827
<i>♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪</i>
<i>♪ 吸水性、黄色
他是多孔的 ♪</i>

00:22.931 --> 00:24.586
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:24.689 --> 00:26.551
<i>♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪</i>

00:26.655 --> 00:28.758
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:28.862 --> 00:30.620
<i>♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪</i>

00:30.724 --> 00:32.551
- <i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
-</i> Ready?
- <i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪
- 准备好了吗？

00:32.655 --> 00:34.517
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:34.620 --> 00:36.793
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:36.896 --> 00:38.448
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:38.551 --> 00:41.931
<i>♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪</i>

00:42.034 --> 00:45.655
<i>Ha ha ha ha!</i>
<i>哈哈哈哈！</i>

00:45.758 --> 00:46.896
<i>Argh!</i>
<i>啊！</i>

01:04.965 --> 01:06.137
Wake up, Gary!
醒来吧，加里！

01:06.241 --> 01:07.448
It's time for
是时候了

01:07.551 --> 01:10.206
<i>Bikini Bottom News
with Perch Perkins.</i>
<i>比基尼泳裤新闻
与鲈鱼帕金斯。</i>

01:12.206 --> 01:14.103
Oh, good thinking, Gary.
哦，好主意，加里。

01:14.448 --> 01:17.413
The news can be
pretty topsy-turvy.
消息可以是
相当颠倒。

01:17.517 --> 01:18.413
Meow.
喵。

01:18.931 --> 01:20.100
<i>Good evening, Bikini Bottom.</i>
<i>晚上好，比基尼泳裤。</i>

01:21.103 --> 01:22.482
<i>In tonight's top story,</i>
<i>在今晚的头条新闻中，</i>

01:22.586 --> 01:25.137
<i>a local squirrel got stuck
in a well.</i>
<i>一只当地的松鼠被卡住了
在一口井里。</i>

01:25.241 --> 01:28.413
<i>Help! Get me outta here, y'all!</i>
救命啊！你们，带我离开这里！</i>

01:28.517 --> 01:30.862
Must be embarrassing
for whoever that is.
一定很尴尬
无论是谁。

01:30.965 --> 01:33.758
<i>But first, radical changes
in machine intelligence</i>
<i>但首先，彻底改变
在机器智能领域</i>

01:33.862 --> 01:37.931
<i>were made today when a local
squirrel got stuck in a well!</i>
<i>是今天当地人制作的
松鼠被困在井里了！</i>

01:39.068 --> 01:40.482
<i>Ow!</i>
<i>噢！</i>

01:42.137 --> 01:45.103
<i>Yee-haw!</i>
<i>哎呀！</i>

01:45.206 --> 01:48.931
<i>Looks like we won't be needing
those lazy firemen anymore!</i>
<i>看起来我们不需要
那些懒惰的消防员了！</i>

01:50.724 --> 01:51.620
<i>Huh?</i>
<i>嗯？</i>

01:51.724 --> 01:52.758
<i>This just in!</i>
<i>这个刚刚进来！</i>

01:52.862 --> 01:55.206
<i>Local TV news reporter
Perch Perkins</i>
<i>当地电视台新闻记者
鲈鱼帕金斯</i>

01:55.310 --> 01:57.241
<i>has been fired!</i>
<i>已被解雇！</i>

01:58.482 --> 02:00.275
- Fired?
- Meow?
- 被解雇？
- 喵？

02:01.137 --> 02:02.620
<i>Fired?</i>
<i>被解雇？</i>

02:02.724 --> 02:04.758
<i>The long-time local
news veteran</i>
<i>长期在本地
新闻老手</i>

02:04.862 --> 02:08.275
<i>is being replaced by the
latest in reporting technology,</i>
<i> 正在被替换为
最新的报告技术，</i>

02:08.379 --> 02:10.827
<i>Newsbot 2000,</i>
<i>新闻机器人 2000，</i>

02:10.931 --> 02:12.793
<i>effective immediately.</i>
<i>立即生效。</i>

02:13.241 --> 02:15.137
<i>Yes. Thank you, Perch.</i>
<i>是的。谢谢你，鲈鱼。</i>

02:15.241 --> 02:16.965
<i>You can't do this to me.</i>
<i>你不能这样对我。</i>

02:17.068 --> 02:19.137
<i>We here at Bikini Bottom News</i>
<i>我们在比基尼泳裤新闻</i>

02:19.241 --> 02:21.965
<i>salute you for
your years of service.</i>
<i>向你致敬
您的服务年限。</i>

02:26.344 --> 02:27.655
Sorry, sir.
对不起，先生。

02:27.758 --> 02:30.827
We can't let you leave
with any company property.
我们不能让你离开
与任何公司财产。

02:32.275 --> 02:34.724
Can't I at least keep the box?
我至少不能保留这个盒子吗？

02:34.827 --> 02:35.827
Of course.
当然。

02:38.896 --> 02:42.517
But the hair belongs
to the studio.
但头发属于
到工作室。

02:47.172 --> 02:49.689
That wasn't a toupee.
那不是假发。

02:53.068 --> 02:54.655
This is terrible!
这太可怕了！

02:54.758 --> 02:57.241
A robot could never replace
someone like Perch
机器人永远无法取代
像鲈鱼这样的人

02:57.344 --> 02:58.241
in our hearts!
在我们心中！

02:58.344 --> 03:00.689
I won't stand for this!
我不会容忍这样的事情！

03:00.793 --> 03:02.931
I'm gonna give that news studio
我要给那个新闻演播室

03:03.034 --> 03:04.517
a piece of my mind!
我的一点心意！

03:06.448 --> 03:08.034
We want Perch!
我们要鲈鱼！

03:08.137 --> 03:09.896
We want Perch!
我们要鲈鱼！

03:10.000 --> 03:11.275
Bring back Perch!
把鲈鱼带回来！

03:11.379 --> 03:12.620
Pardon me, sir.
请原谅我，先生。

03:12.724 --> 03:14.862
Would you care to tell
the folks back home more
你愿意告诉吗
回家的人更多

03:14.965 --> 03:16.758
about your protest?
关于你的抗议？

03:16.862 --> 03:18.620
Oh, of course!
哦，当然！

03:18.724 --> 03:21.482
You see, Perch Perkins
is my favorite newsman
你看，珀奇帕金斯
是我最喜欢的新闻记者

03:21.586 --> 03:22.100
in the whole ocean
在整个海洋中

03:23.103 --> 03:24.620
and--uh. Wait a second.
还有——呃。等一下。

03:24.724 --> 03:25.655
Perch?
栖息？

03:25.758 --> 03:27.275
Is that you?
那是你吗？

03:27.379 --> 03:29.931
No loitering!
不许闲逛！

03:30.275 --> 03:32.103
As a fan of Perch Perkins,
作为Perch Perkins的粉丝，

03:32.206 --> 03:34.931
what do you think
about a robot taking his job?
你觉得怎么样
关于机器人抢走了他的工作？

03:35.034 --> 03:38.172
You can't just replace someone
with a machine!
你不能仅仅取代某人
用机器！

03:38.620 --> 03:40.931
Pat-tron, take over
this protest for me.
Pat-tron，接管
这是对我的抗议。

03:41.310 --> 03:42.793
Perch! Come back!
栖息！回来！

03:42.896 --> 03:44.310
We need you!
我们需要你！

03:50.206 --> 03:51.206
Oh, no.
哦，不。

03:51.310 --> 03:53.896
Old Reporters Row!
老记者行！

03:53.100 --> 03:58.241
Where TV reporters
finish out their off-air years.
电视台记者在哪里
结束他们停播的岁月。

03:58.344 --> 04:02.448
Low of 55. High of 72.
最低价为 55。最高价为 72。

04:02.551 --> 04:05.931
Out top stories--
Back to you, Bob.
热门故事——
回到你身边，鲍勃。

04:06.413 --> 04:07.448
Perch!
栖息！

04:07.551 --> 04:09.413
You don't belong here!
你不属于这里！

04:11.827 --> 04:13.758
Do you trust
your breakfast cereal?
你信任吗
你的早餐麦片吗？

04:13.862 --> 04:16.413
Is King Neptune's crown
too small?
是海王星国王的王冠
太小了？

04:16.517 --> 04:18.137
for or against?
支持还是反对？

04:22.655 --> 04:24.379
Here's a burning story.
这是一个燃烧的故事。

04:24.827 --> 04:28.862
This reporter's stash of
old magazines is running low.
这位记者的藏品
旧杂志所剩无几。

04:29.689 --> 04:31.655
Perch? Thank goodness!
栖息？谢天谢地！

04:31.758 --> 04:33.172
We have to get you outta here!
我们必须带你离开这里！

04:33.275 --> 04:34.655
Why bother?
何苦呢？

04:34.758 --> 04:37.586
The only thing I know
how to do is hold a microphone.
我唯一知道的
该怎么做就是拿着麦克风。

04:37.724 --> 04:40.724
And Newsbot has
that all sewn up.
Newsbot 有
全部缝合起来。

04:41.034 --> 04:42.862
Who else would hire me?
还有谁会雇用我？

04:42.965 --> 04:46.310
There's lots of places that
can use a fish of your talents.
有很多地方都这样
可以利用你的天赋的鱼。

04:46.413 --> 04:47.793
Come on. I'll show ya.
快点。我会告诉你。

04:48.172 --> 04:49.100
Barg'n-Mart?
巴根玛特？

04:52.103 --> 04:53.310
Hmm.
唔。

04:53.413 --> 04:55.344
I suppose we could use someone
我想我们可以找个人

04:55.448 --> 04:57.344
to make in-store announcements.
发布店内公告。

04:57.448 --> 04:59.551
Welcome aboard!
欢迎登机！

05:00.206 --> 05:01.586
Huh?
啊？

05:03.862 --> 05:07.137
Uh... Attention,
Barg'n-Mart shoppers.
呃...注意，
Barg'n-Mart 购物者。

05:07.241 --> 05:10.344
<i>Cheese is on sale
in the dairy aisle.</i>
<i>奶酪特价
在乳制品过道中。</i>

05:13.758 --> 05:15.103
Wow!
哇！

05:15.206 --> 05:18.793
And fresh flowers are marked
down in the floral department!
并标记了鲜花
就在花艺部！

05:25.689 --> 05:28.586
Perch Perkins. Aisle Seven News.
鲈鱼珀金斯。第七通道新闻。

05:28.689 --> 05:30.896
Can you tell us
what happened here?
你能告诉我们吗
这里发生了什么？

05:30.100 --> 05:32.344
Well, Perch.
好吧，鲈鱼。

05:32.448 --> 05:34.034
I was procuring my pickles
我正在采购泡菜

05:34.137 --> 05:37.517
when I noticed my palms
had grown quite dewy.
当我注意到我的手掌时
已经变得非常湿润了。

05:37.620 --> 05:38.896
- Whoa!
- Whoa!
- 哇！
- 哇！

05:38.100 --> 05:42.413
Alas, my realization
came too late!
唉，我的认识
来得太晚了！

05:42.517 --> 05:44.100
My hands,
slickened from exertion,
我的双手，
因劳累而变得光滑，

05:45.103 --> 05:49.172
could not hold on
to their briny bounty!
坚持不住了
为了他们的咸味赏金！

05:49.620 --> 05:51.344
A heart-wrenching tale.
一个令人心碎的故事。

05:51.448 --> 05:52.896
Perkins!
珀金斯！

05:52.100 --> 05:55.310
You're supposed
to call for a clean up!
你应该
呼吁清理！

05:55.413 --> 05:57.620
Not interview the mess maker!
不采访乱七八糟的人！

05:57.724 --> 06:00.655
Look at all
these injured customers!
看看全部
这些受伤的顾客！

06:02.517 --> 06:04.379
My pickled leg!
我的酸腿！

06:04.758 --> 06:07.172
You're fired!
你被解雇了！

06:14.310 --> 06:16.448
Perch!
栖息！

06:16.551 --> 06:17.655
That's okay.
没关系。

06:17.758 --> 06:19.413
I lined up another job for ya.
我为你安排了另一份工作。

06:19.517 --> 06:20.793
Oh.
哦。

06:21.448 --> 06:23.137
Luckily, I know a guy here.
幸运的是，我在这里认识一个人。

06:25.275 --> 06:26.724
Perch. Hey!
栖息。嘿！

06:26.827 --> 06:28.793
Welcome to the Krusty Krab!
欢迎来到蟹堡王！

06:28.896 --> 06:32.862
Always good to have
a former celebrity on the team.
拥有总是好的
团队中的前名人。

06:34.206 --> 06:35.275
Thank you?
谢谢你？

06:35.379 --> 06:37.862
SpongeBob said you're good
on the microphone.
海绵宝宝说你很好
在麦克风上。

06:37.965 --> 06:41.275
So, I'm putting you
on drive-through duty!
所以，我把你
开车通过值班！

06:46.896 --> 06:49.448
Hehe. Haven't used it
in a couple of years.
呵呵。没用过
几年后。

06:49.793 --> 06:52.448
Okay. Start making me
some money.
好的。开始让我
一些钱。

06:52.551 --> 06:54.448
<i>Larry wants to order</i>
<i>拉里想订购</i>

06:54.551 --> 06:55.758
<i>a Krabby Patty.</i>
<i>蟹肉饼。</i>

06:55.862 --> 06:58.172
Would you like fries with that?
你想配薯条吗？

06:58.275 --> 07:00.551
<i>- Sure! Why not?
-</i> Oh.
<i>- 当然！为什么不呢？
- 哦。

07:00.655 --> 07:03.275
<i>Would you like to upgrade
to a Krabby Combo</i>
<i>您想升级吗
到蟹蟹组合</i>

07:03.379 --> 07:04.100
<i>and get a small soda?</i>
<i>喝点苏打水？</i>

07:05.103 --> 07:07.103
Uh, okay?
呃，好吧？

07:07.206 --> 07:09.206
<i>Would you like
to explain why your gym</i>
<i>你愿意吗
解释为什么你去健身房</i>

07:09.310 --> 07:12.344
<i>has been hit
with 15 health code violations</i>
<i>已被击中
违反健康码 15 次</i>

07:12.448 --> 07:14.103
<i>- this month?
-</i> Uh.
<i>- 这个月？
- 呃。

07:14.206 --> 07:16.100
Uh, Larry's a busy lobster,
you know.
呃，拉里是一只忙碌的龙虾，
你知道。

07:17.103 --> 07:20.241
<i>Several hard-hitting
hours later...</i>
<i>几个重击
几个小时后...</i>

07:20.344 --> 07:22.551
Larry just wanted to work out.
拉里只是想锻炼身体。

07:22.655 --> 07:26.724
He didn't mean for all those
people to get athlete's shell!
他并不是为了所有这些
人们得到运动员的外壳！

07:28.586 --> 07:30.068
Perkins!
珀金斯！

07:33.758 --> 07:35.241
Let me guess.
让我猜一下。

07:35.344 --> 07:36.862
You're firing me?
你要解雇我？

07:36.965 --> 07:39.758
Here's the scoop: Yes!
这是独家新闻：是的！

07:41.965 --> 07:44.896
Perch,
where are you going?
鲈鱼,
你要去哪里？

07:44.100 --> 07:48.379
Back to Old Reporter Row
where I belong.
返回老记者区
我属于哪里。

07:48.482 --> 07:50.689
Oh, no. We're not giving up yet!
哦，不。我们还没有放弃！

07:50.793 --> 07:52.379
If you're no good
at anything else,
如果你不好
在任何其他事情上，

07:52.482 --> 07:55.034
then you'll just have
to report the news again.
那么你就会有
再次报告这个消息。

07:55.137 --> 07:56.206
But how?
但如何呢？

07:56.310 --> 07:58.137
Don't you worry.
别担心。

07:58.241 --> 07:59.931
I've got a plan.
我有一个计划。

08:00.379 --> 08:03.482
Please take Perch back!
请把鲈鱼带回来！

08:03.586 --> 08:05.448
You have to!
你必须这样做！

08:05.551 --> 08:07.931
Wah!
哇！

08:08.034 --> 08:11.758
Hmm, as the manager
of this news network,
嗯，作为经理
本新闻网，

08:11.862 --> 08:15.103
give me one good reason
why I should.
给我一个充分的理由
为什么我应该。

08:15.206 --> 08:17.482
Because Perch Perkins
can out-report
因为鲈鱼帕金斯
可以外报

08:17.586 --> 08:19.413
your dumb old Newsbot
你这个愚蠢的老新闻机器人

08:19.517 --> 08:21.448
anytime, anywhere!
随时随地！

08:21.551 --> 08:23.827
Ha. I'd like to see him try.
哈。我想看他尝试一下。

08:23.931 --> 08:25.100
Good. Then you will.
好的。那么你就会的。

08:26.103 --> 08:29.379
SpongeBob, I can't
out-report him.
海绵宝宝我不行
举报他。

08:29.482 --> 08:32.034
The guy's a machine.
Literally.
这家伙是一台机器。
字面上地。

08:32.137 --> 08:34.965
I believe in you, Perch Perkins.
我相信你，珀奇·珀金斯。

08:36.862 --> 08:39.103
Okay.
好的。

08:39.206 --> 08:40.448
It is on.
它已开启。

08:42.965 --> 08:44.100
It's a news-off!
这是一个新闻关闭！

08:45.482 --> 08:46.827
You know the rules.
你知道规则。

08:46.931 --> 08:50.103
Whoever reports the most news
in the time allowed,
谁报道的新闻最多
在允许的时间内，

08:50.206 --> 08:51.137
wins.
获胜。

08:51.241 --> 08:52.379
On your mark.
就你的目标而言。

08:52.482 --> 08:54.034
Get set.
准备好。

08:54.137 --> 08:55.793
News!
消息！

08:57.827 --> 09:00.827
Oh, the huge manatee!
哦，巨大的海牛！

09:01.137 --> 09:04.482
A simple news-off
turned ugly today when--
简单的新闻报道
今天变得丑陋了——

09:04.586 --> 09:06.896
Breaking news!
A pile-up has left
突发新闻！
留下了堆积物

09:06.100 --> 09:09.620
multiple boats mangled
beyond recognition!
多艘船只受损
面目全非！

09:09.724 --> 09:11.103
This just in!
这才刚进！

09:11.206 --> 09:14.551
A towering inferno
in downtown Bikini Bottom!
一座高耸的地狱
在市中心比基尼底部！

09:14.655 --> 09:15.862
News flash!
新闻快讯！

09:16.034 --> 09:18.068
A tidal wave is headed
straight for the city!
浪潮即将来临
直奔城市！

09:18.172 --> 09:20.896
And this reporter has
an exclusive interview!
而这位记者有
独家专访！

09:21.034 --> 09:24.379
Mr. Wave, why are you
doing this?
波先生，你为什么
做这个？

09:32.758 --> 09:34.517
Grr!
咕噜！

09:34.655 --> 09:37.517
Time to turn the news
up a notch!
是时候转一下新闻了
更上一层楼！

09:38.310 --> 09:41.482
Bikini Bottom streets
pocked with potholes!
比基尼街
坑坑洼洼！

09:41.586 --> 09:44.241
<i>Scoop!</i>
<i>独家报道！</i>

09:44.344 --> 09:47.103
Who keeps tipping over
our old ladies?
谁不断翻倒
我们的老太太们？

09:47.206 --> 09:49.862
<i>News flash!</i>
<i>新闻快讯！</i>

09:49.965 --> 09:52.482
The bridge to Shell City
has collapsed!
通往贝壳城的桥梁
已经崩溃了！

09:52.586 --> 09:53.965
My leg!
我的腿！

09:54.068 --> 09:56.862
<i>Exclusive!</i>
<i>独家！</i>

09:58.448 --> 10:03.034
There's no way anyone could
report that much news.
没有人可以做到
报道这么多新闻。

10:03.586 --> 10:05.206
Unless...
除非...

10:05.310 --> 10:07.413
Come on, SpongeBob!
加油，海绵宝宝！

10:07.862 --> 10:10.310
Mysterious rash
covers beach goers!
神秘的皮疹
涵盖海滩爱好者！

10:10.620 --> 10:12.655
Bikini Bottom bank robbed!
比基尼泳裤银行被抢劫！

10:12.965 --> 10:15.206
Vandals strike
local fast food restaurant!
破坏者罢工
当地的快餐店！

10:15.310 --> 10:16.827
Argh!
啊！

10:17.275 --> 10:19.448
We interrupt
this onslaught of news
我们打断
这波新闻的冲击

10:19.551 --> 10:20.896
to bring you a special report.
为您带来特别报道。

10:21.000 --> 10:23.758
Local news robot, Newsbot,
本地新闻机器人，Newsbot，

10:23.862 --> 10:27.000
has been causing
the very stories he reports on!
已经造成
他所报道的故事！

10:27.103 --> 10:29.137
<i>He destroys the bridges!</i>
<i>他摧毁了桥梁！</i>

10:31.689 --> 10:33.241
<i>He robs the banks!</i>
<i>他抢劫银行！</i>

10:39.655 --> 10:42.310
<i>He tips over the old ladies!</i>
<i>他给老太太们打翻了！</i>

10:44.379 --> 10:47.551
And right now,
he is cutting the brakes
而现在，
他正在踩刹车

10:47.655 --> 10:51.448
on this bus full
of adorable baby snails!
这辆巴士上满了
可爱的小蜗牛！

10:51.551 --> 10:53.448
Excuse me, Newsbot.
对不起，新闻机器人。

10:53.551 --> 10:55.862
Care to comment on your crimes?
愿意评论一下你的罪行吗？

10:55.965 --> 10:58.862
Uh-uh--This isn't
what it looks like!
呃呃——这不是
它看起来像什么！

10:58.965 --> 11:01.448
It looks like you
ran out of news
看起来像你
没有新闻了

11:01.551 --> 11:03.448
so you made your own.
所以你自己做了。

11:03.551 --> 11:05.413
I--uh--
我——呃——

11:05.517 --> 11:07.000
So, which came first?
那么，哪个先出现呢？

11:07.103 --> 11:09.827
The news story or the reporter?
新闻故事还是记者？

11:09.931 --> 11:13.379
N-news! R-reporter! Old ladies!
N新闻！ R-记者！老太太们！

11:13.482 --> 11:15.206
Exploding boats-- My face!
爆炸的船——我的脸！

11:15.310 --> 11:19.379
For more, let's go to our man
on the street.
了解更多，让我们去找我们的男人
在街上。

11:19.586 --> 11:20.896
Newsbot.
新闻机器人。

11:23.586 --> 11:26.275
Report! Report! Report! Report!
报告！报告！报告！报告！

11:26.379 --> 11:27.827
Explode!
爆炸！

11:29.862 --> 11:31.862
Congratulations, Perch.
恭喜你，鲈鱼。

11:31.965 --> 11:34.586
Looks like you are un-fired!
看来你还没有被解雇！

11:35.482 --> 11:37.689
Hooray! You did it!
万岁！你做到了！

11:37.793 --> 11:39.896
Here's your news hair back!
这是您的新闻发回来了！

11:42.758 --> 11:44.241
This just in.
这个刚进去

这个刚进去